{
  "slug": "indian-family-drafting",
  "name": "Indian Family Drafting",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "For every advocate practising before India's Family Courts under the Family Courts Act 1984 and the matrimonial-jurisdiction tier of District Courts, this open-source Claude Code plugin standardises drafting across India's plural personal-law regimes — Hindu Marriage Act 1955, Special Marriage Act 1954, Indian Divorce Act 1869, Muslim Personal Law, Parsi Marriage and Divorce Act 1936 — and the State Family-Court overlay applicable to the parties. The structural skeleton is uniform; personal-law and State overlay are supplied by the user via a family-config file. Battle-tested for Divorce (HMA / SMA / IDA), Judicial Separation, Restitution of Conjugal Rights, Nullity of Marriage, Maintenance (Section 125 BNSS + Section 24 HMA + Section 18 HAMA), Custody and Guardianship (Guardians and Wards Act 1890 + Hindu Minority and Guardianship Act 1956), Domestic Violence reliefs (PWDVA 2005), and Adoption (HAMA / Juvenile Justice Act 2015). Six-agent drafting pipeline (Reader → Format → Drafter → Verifier → Refiner → Overseer) and shared family pleading base. The finished product is a filing-ready petition, application, or written statement the counsel can lodge at the Family Court the same working day.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **6 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `_drafting_common` (Shared reference for all family-law drafting skills (divorce / judicial separation / restitution of conjugal rights / nullity…), `_family_pleading_base` (Universal Indian family-law / matrimonial-jurisdiction pleading skeleton), `adoption-petition-draft` (Draft a petition for adoption of a child under (a) the Hindu Adoptions and Maintenance Act 1956 (HAMA…), `custody-petition-draft` (Draft a petition for custody / guardianship of a minor child under the Guardians and Wards Act 1890…), `divorce-petition-draft` (Draft a divorce petition under any applicable Indian personal law — Hindu Marriage Act 1955 Section 13 (cruelty…), `dv-act-application-draft` (Draft an application for reliefs under the Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act 2005 (DV Act), filed…), `judicial-separation-draft` (Draft a petition for judicial separation under Section 10 of the Hindu Marriage Act 1955 / Section 23…), `maintenance-application-draft` (Draft a maintenance application under any of the multiple Indian maintenance regimes — Section 125 BNSS (corresponding to…), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (6): `drafter` (Third agent in Indian family-law drafting pipeline), `format` (Second agent in Indian family-law drafting pipeline), `overseer` (Sixth and final agent in Indian family-law drafting pipeline), `reader` (First agent in Indian family-law drafting pipeline), `refiner` (Fifth agent in Indian family-law drafting pipeline), `verifier` (Fourth agent in Indian family-law drafting pipeline)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install indian-family-drafting@claude-community` from `Wolfgangrush/indian-family-drafting-litigation`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
